# kk: Support new M6 texel buffer formats
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45112 state=merged
# ### What does this MR do and why?

```
kk: Support new M6 texel buffer formats

M6+ supports 24, 48, and 96-bit RGB texel buffers.
```
